Package: onedevr
Title: Access to the OneDev REST API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Alex", "Seymer", email = "alex@seymer.at", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: R client for the OneDev project management REST API. Provides
    low-level request helpers and high-level convenience functions for
    issues, projects, builds, and pull requests. Designed for self-hosted
    OneDev instances. Modeled on gitlabr for the R API shape; OneDev
    conventions follow the tod CLI (https://github.com/theonedev/tod).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://alexseymer.github.io/onedevR/,
    https://github.com/alexseymer/onedevR
BugReports: https://github.com/alexseymer/onedevR/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0),
    jsonlite (>= 1.8.0),
    rlang (>= 1.0.0)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.1.0),
    mockery,
    withr,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    pkgdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/Needs/website: pkgdown
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
